Not ready yet? I know you must be afraid.
But you have already shown all your bravery.

I will be with you. Let us make this one last effort together.

Let us put an end to Midranda with this Awakened Magic Censer. The power it gives off is incredible.

Defeat the Resurrected Midranda in the Sanctuary of the Abyss and, when you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
